window.products.push({"id":1032130,"name":"Electric Mini Garlic Chopper, USB Rechargeable Portable Electric Food Chopper, 250ML Wireless Small Food Processor for Chopping Garlic, Ginger, Chili,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvFndGb+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【EFFICIENT AND VERSATILE】: Our electric garlic press is a high-performance kitchen tool that can quickly chop garlic, seasonings, nuts, onions, vegetables, peppers, minced meat, and even ice cubes. Its 3 sharp blades and 30w motor make it easy to process small amounts of food for cooking, children's food supplements, and smoothie drinks. 【DURABLE AND SAFE】: Made with 304 stainless steel blades and high-quality food-grade ABS material, our mini electric food chopper is rugged and durable. Its masher cup safely contains mashed food, making it a reliable partner for mothers, wives, and professional chefs. Additionally, the shredder is designed with safe protection to prevent accidents during use. 【ONE-BUTTON CONTROL】: With our garlic press, you can easily chop food with just one button. Simply put your ingredients in the chopper, lock the lid, and press the button to get evenly shredded food in seconds. The bowl and blade can be separated for easy cleaning, and the shredder can be quickly cleaned with water. 【PORTABLE AND CONVENIENT】: Our mini electric chopper is designed for portability and convenience. It uses USB charging and takes only 3 hours to charge, allowing it to be used about 50 times. Its small and lightweight size makes it easy to pack in a backpack, perfect for family, camping, or other outdoor activities. 【EASY TO USE AND CLEAN】: The mini food shredder is super easy to disassemble and use. Simply remove the hood, and you can clearly see the second layer of protection cover, cups, blades, and all parts. It's also easy to clean, and you can take out the blade first to avoid cutting your hands. Overall, our garlic press is a great gift for camping and travel lovers, as well as anyone who loves cooking and wants to save time and energy in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pvFndGb+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LVSENLIN","source_asin":"B09T2SC12H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2SC12H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2SC12H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
