window.products.push({"id":1032169,"name":"Mxmoonant Ultrasonic Mist Maker 3 Head 12 LED Lights Mist Maker Fogger with Float 6 Spare Ceramics Discs for Humidifying Mushroom Other Small Plants(B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QVtyjwelL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Looking for Something to Humidify Plants?]----3 Head Mist Maker Fogger produce a large amount of mist through 1.7MHz frequency. Different from the industrial humidifier, the mist maker can be small-scale humidification, tailor-made for small plants, like mushrooms, while saving water resources. [Easy to Operate]----Only 3 steps to use this Mist Maker. 1. Connect the power cord and mist maker; 2.Place the Ultrasonic Mist Maker in the water with the front facing up; 3.Plug in the power supply to create a lot of mist. When the item is short of water during operation, it will be powered off in time, safe and reliable. [Equipped with Float and 6 Ceramic Discs]----The float can help the mister maintain a proper water level to achieve the best fogging effect. The ceramic disc can be used for 3000 hours under normal circumstances. Equipped with 6 discs to extend the life of Ultrasonic Mist Maker. [Parameters]----Voltage: 100-240V, US Plug; Maximum evaporation: 1500ml/H; Use water depth: 2 23/64’’-3 35/64’’(6-9cm); LED lights are illuminated in the order of factory settings and cannot be customized. [Important Note]----Under normal circumstances, the service life of the 3 head mister is about 6 months. If the proper water quality(tap water without essence), water level(6-9cm) and usage time(not exceed 10 hours per day) are ensured, it can be used for a longer time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QVtyjwelL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mxmoonant","source_asin":"B08LYFGSSF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032169","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LYFGSSF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LYFGSSF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
