window.products.push({"id":1032210,"name":"Daily Comma Aurora Gradation Reed Diffuser Oil Diffuser with Reed Diffuser Stick, Home Decor and Aromatherapy 6.6oz (Black Cherry)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sDrllc2bL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"FILL YOUR SPACE WITH “DAILY COMMA”! Welcome to DAILY COMMA! We proudly offer reed diffusers in a variety of scents. Make your area delightful and comfortable with your favorite scents! Either fruit or aroma scents are nice. They are helpful for purifying the fragrance of the living room. They are also helpful for sleeping in the bed room. Herb or powdery scents are suitable for purifying smells from bathroom. In library and study room, black cherry and fresh grapefruit might be a good choice. We also only use fragrance oil which is approved by International Fragrance Association. HIGHLY RECOMMEND FOR: * If your area have bad odor when you enter * If you want to relax your whole body * If you hate the smell of alcohol in the diffuser * If you want a reed diffuser made from natural ingredients * If you want to increase your concentration while working or studying Q&A ABOUT DAILY COMMA DIFFUSER: Q. What is the shelf life? A. Prior to opening, it can be stored at room temperature for about 3 years. After opening, it is recommended to be used within 6 months. Q. How long can it be used? A. After opening, 100ml can be used for about 30 to 40 days. 200ml will last about 3 months. Q. How can I control the intensity of scents? A. The narrower the space, the higher the temperature, the lower the humidity, the better the air circulation, the more intense the scent will be. Please adjust the number of sticks according to the space to control the scent. Q. Can I mix different scents of diffusers for use? A. Our product was created after countless tests by a professional perfumer and R&D team. Therefore, it is not recommended to mix and use scents arbitrarily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51sDrllc2bL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAILY COMMA","source_asin":"B08WPWJ76K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WPWJ76K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WPWJ76K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032211,"name":"soda maker adapter replacement washer or o rings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8LkN9dgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"How it works: 1.Screw the Nut to a commercial CO2 gas cylinder and tighten it by wrench;2.The black pin valve screwed into Soda Water machine;3.Open the valve of the large gas bottle;4.Done,you can enjoy your sparkling water. if you want unscrew the pin valve from the machine: 1.Close valve of the large gas bottle;2.Press button more serval time to drain residual Co2(if you disconnect the coupler directly without this step,the o ring in quick coupler will be blowed out);3.Disconnect the quick coupler. IMPORTANT NOTE: Please kindly read before you ordering or using:1.Don't use siphon tube Co2 Tanks!! Our unit works with GAS CO2 only, not liquid CO2. liquid CO2 will create a bad taste in your drink. 2.if you want disconnect the coupler,please press the machine button more serval time to drain residual gas,or else the o ring in coupler will be blowed out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51k8LkN9dgL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VaVoger","source_asin":"B0B71GW27K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032211","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B71GW27K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B71GW27K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
