window.products.push({"id":1032259,"name":"ZEROJAPAN Saturn teapot S 300cc banana milk BBN-17S BAM (japan import)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719AvOnIMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ZERO JAPAN INC. was established in 1992. Gifu pref. especially around our area called MINO. The history of producing the ceramic ware is very old. It began hundreds of years ago. We tried to learn the traditional skills from the history and combine the new technique to produce our products. We have been trying to keep our ideology since the beginning. It consists of three concepts: Good Looking, The Good Touch and very useful. These three simple concepts are what makes our products special. We also design our new items based on these ideas. ZERO JAPAN is proud to introduce eMade in Japan' on all of our original products have been successfully marketed in the U.S.A. ZERO JAPAN products are getting well recognized in several countries as well. We try to develop the new idea and new design which has not been seen on the market yet. We also try to produce the items which are left in the history for the future. ZERO JAPAN products would like to be loved and to be with your happy life for a long time. All the products are Made in Japan and the design and the quality is getting high reputation from many countries. We check the quality and assemble one by one with the strict manuals at our own warehouse in Japan. The quality has been maintained and improved since we start our production.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719AvOnIMlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZERO JAPAN(ゼロジャパン)","source_asin":"B004H0MCVE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004H0MCVE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004H0MCVE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032260,"name":"Mattress Protector Waterproof Full Size Mattress Cover Washable Bed Sheet Noiseless Soft Breathable Cotton Terry Vinyl-Free Deep Pocket Matressprotect","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814MTEHtrqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Impervious to Liquids of All Kinds: Everyone experiences unexpected accidents and spills in bed, so protecting your precious mattress is a must! Now, it’s easy with our full size waterproof mattress protector. Specially designed TPU membrane effectively prevents all liquids from leaking, including coffee, juice, pet accidents, urine, and other body fluids of all kinds. Great for kids, pets, incontinence care, etc. Ultra-Soft & Noiseless: Premium Fitted Cotton Terry Cover surface is softer and more comfortable than ordinary fabric protectors, making it soft enough to use even on its own. and molds to, the contour of your mattress, making your bed the perfect place for a comfortable and healthy sleeping environment. Our full size bed cover will not change the feel of your mattress. You can rest assured, knowing that there will be no crinkling sound or plasticky feel to disrupt your valuable sleep. Easy to Clean & Durable: Instead of throwing away your entire mattress, you can easily protect and extend its life with a premium quality bed mattress protector. After an accident, simply throw the contaminated mattress pad into the washing machine. （Note: Tumble dry on low. Do not bleach. Do not dry clean）For frequent accidents, we suggest buying two or more mattress protectors to always have another on hand while one is in the wash. Ultimate Safeguard: Our full mattress cover is designed to keep your mattress clean and protect you from contaminants which can harm your health and the integrity of your sleeping environment. Our premium bed mattress cover is great for those with kids, pets or incontinence issues. Fitted Sheet Style: 360°anti-skid fully-surrounded elastic band ensures the deep pocket mattress protector stays in place, and never slip or bunch up like others. Matressprotector are available in 4 different sizes Fitted 14\" - 18\" Deep Pocket . We provide 30-day Return/Replacement Service.If you are not satisfied for any reason, Pls contact our Customer Support and we will do everything to make you satisfied.so you can purchase worry-free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814MTEHtrqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAPLAY","source_asin":"B08R9DG4WB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032260","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9DG4WB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9DG4WB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032261,"name":"Christmas Table Decorations Set of 3 Centerpiece Sign Rustic Wood Plaque Hanging Wall Art Box Hanging Decoration Wooden Wall Decor for Office Desk She","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-sZQ35bML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate your holiday decorations with the set of 3 Christmas wall art table decor. The set captures the nostalgic Christmas look with a rustic wooden design. It’s a new take on a classic holiday decoration. Set of 3 designs includes: It's the most wonderful time of the year, Believe in the magic of Christmas, and Have a holly jolly Christmas. These sayings are printed in metallic red on a white wooden slats background with greenery and berries. The perfect complement or centerpiece for your holiday decor, the Christmas inspirational signs set is a great home accent on a table or nestled on a shelf for the holiday season! Suits any room or decor, Ideal for banquets, receptions, meetings and other events! It's easy to pop on any table top, desk, shelf or counter. Ideal for your living room side table, dining table, fireplace mantel or kitchen with these adorable Christmas party decorations. Great for the Holiday season or as a Christmas gift to family, friends, and coworkers! Best gift for your girlfriend, wife and wedding gifts to bride and groom. Has no electronic or battery-operated parts and can be set up anywhere in the home for an effortlessly elegant display. Christmas table toppers are made with high quality card board to last. You can be sure it will last all season and you can even put it away and save it for next year’s special day. Measures: 5.75\" x 5.75\" x 1\". Just the right size to make a statement at your Christmas Party!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-sZQ35bML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gift Boutique","source_asin":"B08VF2V3PZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VF2V3PZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VF2V3PZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032262,"name":"EGR UV700 Filter Replacement for Shark DuoClean Speed Lift-away Zero-M Upright Vacuum NV601, NV611, NV770, NV771, ZU701 Parts XFF600, XHF600 (2 HEPA +","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+mHtnRgrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Compatible Model】Quality douclean filter for your shark. Compatible with NV601, NV611, NV770, NV771, UV700. 【Easy to Install】The filter is made of high-strength environmental protection material. These replacement parts are easy to install and remove. 【Excellent Quality】High-quality filter improves the cleaning performance and powerful suction of the vacuum cleaner. No noise or clogging, feel the difference of an upgraded vacuum and enjoy easier cleaning. 【Replacement suggestion】Washable and reusable. It is recommended to replace the felt filter and foam every 3 months and the HEPA filter every 6 months to maintain optimum vacuum performance based on usage. 【Great Value Set】Set includes: 4 Foam & 4 Felt Filters & 2 HEPA Filters, 1 Cleaning Brush","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+mHtnRgrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EGR","source_asin":"B09Q7Z7LTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032262","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7Z7LTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7Z7LTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
