window.products.push({"id":1032282,"name":"Milk Frother Handheld,Battery Operated Electric Mixer with Stainless Steel Stand,Frother for Coffee,Latte,Cappuccino,Hot Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LqSzHuDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🦋 Pretty snappy Milk Frother! The HAIKARSTA handheld frother is simple designed but reliable. It’s a nice looking, small absolutely practical. The on/off button located on the top of the frother, no settings or modes.The plastic casing is pretty tough, the lightweight plastic build handle is ergonomically designed and super handy. The wire of the frother rod is straight and tough, not likely to bend by accident. 🥛 Easy operating Foam Maker! Press and hold the button while frothering, loose the button to stop. Really easy to operate, most customers like the ease of use. Some tips: ①Hold it at a 45 degree angle! You do have to be careful to not raise it too high in your drink, or you may be wearing it instead of drinking It! ②Make sure it does not touch walls or bottom of your cup, or it slows down and makes noise. 🍵 Easy to clean Drink Mixer! Turn on the drink mixer under running water or put it in some water in a cup for a few seconds, wipe to dry, or hang it in a stand. The stand come with the frother, an expensive looks nice on your counter, doesn’t take up a lot of space to keep it easily accessible near your drink station. Note: Avoid getting the handle wet while rinsing, otherwise may cause burning the motor up! ☕ Really powerful Mini Foamer! The mini foamer equipped with a built-in motor, the rotation speed is up to 14000rpm, provide powerful energy for foaming, faster than most of competitors. Only two AA batteries are necessary to power the foamer, can probably last for 1000 cups milk stirring. If you notice that it struggles to keep a decent speed and power, change new batteries, in case doesn’t work yet, contact us! 🍸 Change coffee lovers’ life! Own the HAIKARSTA milk frother, you can enjoy the coffeehouse quality drinks at home every day. It’s super addition to your morning coffee routine and more. It also suitable for making hot and cold chocolate, milkshakes, matcha tea, mixed drinks, and even for whisking egg whites. Click the buy now button! Start a wonderful day from a creamy cappuccino or latte!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LqSzHuDuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAIKARSTA","source_asin":"B0BWF4BZK4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWF4BZK4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWF4BZK4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
