window.products.push({"id":1032284,"name":"Carl Jung Plush Finger Puppet and Refrigerator Magnet - Toy for Kids or Adults","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fcF1KO-hL._AC_SL1144_.jpg","description":"Bring balance and harmony to your hand with this Jung finger puppet. In your puppet collection he'll examine the collective unconscious of the puppet community! On your finger it's a puppet! Our mini hand puppets are great for storytelling, puppet theater, class, mock debates, or thumb wrestling matches. Also great for gift bags, baskets stockings, etc. On your fridge it's a magnet! Adorn yours (or your locker, or other metal surface) with the most influential minds of all time. We make over 100 different puppets of your favorite artists, philosophers, scientists, writers, and pop-culture icons. Each collectible puppet is 4\" tall and comes with a removable tag with a portrait, quotes, and achievements list. They're educational, and often used by teachers in school classrooms for learning exercises! Click the store link near the product title for more clever and funny novelty gifts. Christmas, birthday, any fun occasion! If you need trendy stocking stuffers or a gag gift that is unique and quirky, or smart and satirical UPG has presents of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fcF1KO-hL._AC_SL1144_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Unemployed Philosophers Guild","source_asin":"B001W31TN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001W31TN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001W31TN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032285,"name":"Bedol – Recyclable & Eco-Friendly Water Clock – Alarm Clock Without Batteries or Electricity – Clock for Bedroom – Easy to Set Modern Clock – Clocks w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61brUNsLhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bedol Water Clock keeps perfect time without batteries or electricity. Just pop open the fill cap and add water. Cutting-edge technology enables the amazing Bedol Water Clock to generate it own clean energy. Electrodes within the water reservoir convert ions into a current strong enough to power the clock for 3-month or more. A built in memory chip ensures you never need to reset the time while changing the water. Hassle-free alternative energy makes this clock a great green gift. A fool-proof, fun way to decrease your carbon footprint. Great for travel and camping. Don't be caught without an alarm the next time the power goes out. Cut down on tangled wires from your desktop. Never make an extra trip to the store for batteries, or find out your batteries have died just when you need them most. The playful, organic design is inspired by nature and captures the beauty and grace of falling water. The Bedol Water Clock is a truly unique accessory for home or office. Features a daily or hourly alarm and an easy to set 12-hour or 24-hour time setting. Made of Non-PVC Plastic. Fully Recyclable. The Bedol Water Clock: Time powered by water, another leap forward towards a greener planet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61brUNsLhfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedol","source_asin":"B004M17URY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004M17URY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004M17URY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
