window.products.push({"id":1032535,"name":"Bamboo Steamer Basket 10 Inch, GEEKERA 2 Tiers Dumpling Steamer for Dimsum, Vegetables, Meat, Fish, Bao Buns, Included Chopsticks, 50 Parchment Liners","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aHx8ODdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NATURAL BAMBOO MATERIAL - Bamboo steamer is made of 100% natural bamboo material, ensures the food healthy and fresh, Each bamboo steamer set included a 10\" 2 tiers dumpling basket , 50pcs parchment liners, 1pair of chopsticks and 1 silicone brush, 1 sauce dish. A HEALTHY COOKING TOOL - Bamboo Steamer basket is a healthy cooking tool, the steamed food not only retains its healthy benefits(to retain vital nutrients, minerals and vitamins) but also keeps its shape, natural flavor, texture and color. Since bamboo naturally absorbs water, there is no condensation inside the steamer that can drip onto the food. 2 TIERS DESIGN - GEEKERA 10 inch bamboo steamer allows more cooking options than the other basket steamers. It can be used as a dumpling steamer, dim sum steamer and bao steamer. You can cook and steam 2 tier at the same time, more efficiency and energy saving. Each Tier Offers 10\" Diameter x 2.4\" Depth; Interior Diameter: 9.25\". MAKE YOUR FOOD TASTIER - Cooking by bamboo steamer, food can be cooked with uniform temperatures, creating better tasting and more consistent results. The food is cooked from the top and bottom simultaneously, retaining all of the natural moisture and flavors that make your food taste great. Users experience benefits not seen in traditional steamers, such as consistent and faster cook times, no cross-flavoring and instant recovery. CARE INSTRUCTIONS - Bamboo steamers aren't dishwasher safe. Please place wax paper before using the dumpling steamer to make cleaning easier. To clean your bamboo steamer, wash with a sponge and soap, and immediately rinse thoroughly. Let your bamboo steamer completely dry on the rack before putting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aHx8ODdTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEEKERA","source_asin":"B08HCP7BQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HCP7BQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HCP7BQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
