window.products.push({"id":1032547,"name":"Oscenlife 8 Bundles Artificial Flowers Outdoor UV Resistant Fake Flowers for Home Decoration, No Fade Faux Plastic Greenery Shrubs Plants for Indoor P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ju32fuCpS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Realistic Look】: Each faux flower in the bundle gives the appearance of a real, natural flower. Artificial flowers are a practical alternative to real florals and will remain fresh-looking and beautiful year after year! They are the perfect DIY craft material for decorating flower baskets or flower pots. 【Maintenance Free】: Enjoy the long-lasting beauty of the lifelike UV-resistant fake flower without having to worry about sunlight, watering, pruning, or other maintenance; these faux flowers are forever-in-bloom wherever you choose to display them. 【Multi-Functional Decoration】: Designed for outdoor decoration. These lifelike flowers lend gorgeous charm to your front porch, walkway, patio, and garden; faux flowers are perfect for everyday decoration, birthdays, holidays, weddings, memorial sites, DIY projects, etc. 【Size】: These flowers are handmade to offer a more unique look in every bundle. Each bouquet has 7 flexible stems and bushy leaves. Each measures 14\" high x 7.5\" Wide. The stems are capable of adjusting the bending angle freely. If found petal falls, just plug it back in the stem. 【Buy with Confidence】: If you have any problem with our fake flower, you can click “seller contact” button in your Amazon account to email us. If you are not 100% satisfied, just send it back and we'll give you a full refund - no awkward.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ju32fuCpS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OscenLife","source_asin":"B096XQQDRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096XQQDRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096XQQDRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032548,"name":"Annser LCD Digital Kitchen Timer Cooking Large Count Down Up Lanyard Hole Clock (Purple)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d8GAMYdTL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Battery Installation Open the battery door on the back-side of the unit. Inser AAA/LR03 size battry into the battry compartment,observing correct +/- polarities.Place the battery door back onto the battery compartment . Setting the Colck Enter the clock mode by pressing the MODE key. The clock icon will appear on the LCD.To set the hour, press HOUR key until the desired hour appear on the LCD.To set the minute, press MIN key until the desired minute appear on the LCD.To set the second, press SEC key until the desired second appear on the LCD. To select 12Hr or 24Hr clock mode format by pressing the START/STOP key. The PM icon will appear on the LCD for 12Hr format. Countdown Timer Enter the timer mode by pressing the MODE key as many times as necessary until the timer icon appear on the LCD.Press HOUR key to set the desired hour. Press MIN key to set the desired minute.Press SEC key to set the desired second. To start or stop/pause the time, press START/STOP key. The alarm will beep for 1 min if left idle.Press any key to stop the alarm sound. Note:the display will revert to showing the current countdown time set. Reset the countdown time back to zero by pressing and holding the MIN and SEC keys at the same time until the display shows \"00:00:00\". The timer needs to stop running before it can be reset. Count Up Timer Under timer mode,press the START/STOP key to start the count up. Press the START/STOP key to pause and press again to resume the count up.The alarm will beep for 1 min when the max.Time limit \"23:59:59\" is reached. Reset the count up time back to zero by pressing and holding the MIN and SEC keys at the same time until the display shows \"00:00:00\". The timer needs to stop running before it can be reset.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61d8GAMYdTL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Annser","source_asin":"B01M99EG0Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M99EG0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M99EG0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
