window.products.push({"id":1032768,"name":"NEWTRY Induction Sealer Heat Handheld Sealing Machine Diameter 0.79’’-3.94’’ Electromagnetic Manual Power & Time Adjustable for Plastic Glass Bottles ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CFFnMTiZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WONDERFUL PERFORMANCE]--The sealing machine has a wide sealing power adjustment range: 500W-1000W, which meets the needs of many customers. The adjustable range of time is: 0.1-5.9 seconds. [POWER-OFF MEMORY ]--The display makes it easy to set the timer which allows users to seal bottles with plastic caps in a short time. When the sealer restarts, it will automatically display the parameters of the last sealing, which provides convenience for users. [PORTABLE & ERGONOMICAL]--This sealing machine with little noise puts everything you need into one hand held item. The design of the sealer handle conforms to human biology so that users will not feel fatigued when using the sealer for a long time. [EASY TO USE]--The digital panel makes sealing easier. Just set the time and power, it takes a few minutes of experimentation, acclimation to the machine, then you're good to go. We provide customers with two 0.98’’ diameter bottles(with inside aluminum foil) for sealing test. Usually the sealing time of the test bottle is 3 seconds and the corresponding power is 800W. [WIDE APPLICATIONS]--This electromagnetic induction sealer is widely used for sealing plastic bottles and glass bottles in the fields of pharmaceutical, chemical industry, food, beverage, greased products, lubricating oil, antifreeze fluid, etc. It can not be used for metal caps for aluminum foil sealing, metal bottles and sharp-nosed caps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CFFnMTiZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWTRY","source_asin":"B08BHZ1YVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032768","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BHZ1YVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BHZ1YVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
