window.products.push({"id":1032832,"name":"LinenZone Maya - Premium Textured Thermal Weaved Heavy Duty Blackout Curtain by Energy Efficient - Noise Reduction - Blocks 97% of Light & UV Rays (Pa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FL2+l25uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAVE MONEY ON ELECTRIC & GAS BILLS This Quality Textured 100% Blackout Curtain By LinenZone! Do you want a place to work or rest in that is clear of sunlight during the day? Are you looking for a window blackout panel that is impressive, practical and yet, affordable? If yes, then look no further! This beautifully designed heavy-duty blackout curtain is just what you are looking for! Sleep Tight & Save On Your Heating & Cooling Costs. No matter how well you think you may be sleeping now, if you decide to use a triple thermal weaved curtain that is able to reduce up to 40% of outside noises, and 100% OF SUNLIGHT AND HARMFUL UV RAY you will see that you sleep better than you could ever imagine! Apart from creating a calm and quiet sleeping or working environment, this panel is also a cost reduction factors for your heating and cooling costs, due to the fact that it prevents heat or cool loss inside the room that it is in! Refresh Your House Decoration. No one can deny that a new curtain refreshes the aura of any room. You can hang this stylish curtain over your windows and immediately change the entire room atmosphere! Durable Fabric & Excellent Construction, our premium quality 100% polyester thermal weaved heavy duty window cover is the proof that we don't compromise our quality over quantity! So Stop Scrolling Now! Order Your Own High Quality Blackout Roberta Collection Curtain By LinenZone Today Before We Run Out Of Stock!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FL2+l25uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LinenZone","source_asin":"B01J46D7Z0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032832","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J46D7Z0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J46D7Z0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032833,"name":"Iwo Jima Memorial by Gregory O'Hanlon, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fSpcU6fYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a photograph of the two Iwo Jima Memorial. Gregory O'Hanlon is attracted by shapes, patterns and textures found in the natural and man-made worlds. It is the co-existence and interaction between these environments, enhanced through the interplay of light and the changing seasons, that inspire his appreciation. Gregory's photographs capture forever the transitory alignment of these elements. A transformation occurs through a combination of specialized skill and creative vision. Subtle yet precise digital manipulation of the images shape the scene to reveal its essence. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fSpcU6fYL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BLY6A3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BLY6A3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BLY6A3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
