window.products.push({"id":1032872,"name":"1-Ounce Retro Shot Glasses set of 6 - Drinking like an Ancient King/Queen - Unique Clear Glass Sipping Cup Dispenser Bulk for liquor Soju tequila Whis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R+Kl8Wv-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a unique shot glass that you can use to drink your favorite spirits or tea. Such as soju, baijiu, white wine, blue agave, vodka, tequila, cordials, green tea, espresso and liqueur. APPLICATION Size: 3.35\" x 1.96\" x 3.54\", Set of 6.Capacity: 1 oz (30ml). Drinking like an Ancient King/Queen If you want to make a special tequila, please choose it, it will always be refreshing. It is an interesting object whether on the table or decoration. In China those unique cups is called the Emperor Shot Glasses , an ancient drinking vessel for the use of the emperor and aristocracy. This shot glass imitating the ancient emperor's shot glass, adding new design elements to make it more interesting. This unique cute shot glass is a great gift idea for your friends. For those who enjoy Chinese/Asian/ancient culture I highly recommend it whether you want a cool drinking cup or just a conversation piece on a shelf. These funny shot glasses are well-made and functional making it perfect for consistent use. Made of lead free glass, safer than plastic, these shot glasses are the good choice for drinking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61R+Kl8Wv-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tom's Wheezes","source_asin":"B08Z4CRLWK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032872","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z4CRLWK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z4CRLWK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032873,"name":"CoTa Global Giraffe Plush Refrigerator Magnet - Fluffy Yellow Giraffe Stuffed Plush Magnet, Cute Wild Life Magnet For Kitchen Fridge & Locker, Home De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RrrC681dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE YELLOW GIRAFFE PLUSH TOY MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you & display your collection of animal novelty magnets! Soft & fluffy home decor to add cuteness to any surface that attracts magnets. CoTa Global's Giraffe Plush Fridge Magnet will surely attract anyone who sees the adorable stuffed magnet decor. A must-have home & office accessory to use as convenient note holders & home or office decor. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home and office ornament for magnet collectors and animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique and decorative plush magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Includes 1 CoTa Global Yellow Giraffe Plush Fridge Magnet. The collectible magnet features a cuddly giraffe decorated with black soft plush mane, a long tail & soft horns. The unique magnetic decor is designed with realistic animal details & colored with yellow & brown spots, making it the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnet measures about 4 inches. HIGH-QUALITY WILD LIFE PLUSH ANIMAL MAGNET – Fun magnets for refrigerator and locker are made of 100% polyester materials with high-quality soft fillings & a strong magnet attached to the back of the 3D-shaped plush giraffe animal figure. The magnetic giraffe plush figure looks so adorable with its little plastic eyes. Use the beautifully designed plush giraffe magnetic decor to add an irresistibly charming accessory to your stationery. IDEAL USE FOR THE WILD ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, and any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Yellow giraffe magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, & drawings. A perfectly functional & multi-use magnet for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RrrC681dS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B0048W5F0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0048W5F0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0048W5F0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
