window.products.push({"id":1032902,"name":"Levtex Home - Marley Ruche Quilt Set - Kids Twin/Twin XL Quilt and One Standard Sham - Ruched - Pink, Green and White - Quilt (66x86in.) and Sham (20x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iSH147ASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton THE MARLEY RUCHE DESIGN: One of our most popular quilt sets, Marley Ruche is inspired by sweet bedtime stories. The front features a fun mix of striped, gingham, and dotted patterns ruched together with dimensional white fabric, and reverses to a simple striped pattern in pink, white, and green. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from the softest cotton and filled with a polyester filler, this quilt will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable. The Marley Ruche quilt has an ultra soft feel that you will simply love. Our quilt (66x86in.) and the matching sham are designed to give your kid's bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Marley Ruche quilt is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated quilt set. The pink, grey, and white design brings cute and cozy accents into your little girl's bedroom and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen the room with other items from the Marley Ruche collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iSH147ASL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B00N09ZZXA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00N09ZZXA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00N09ZZXA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032903,"name":"YiFeng 241Pcs Christmas Window Clings, Double-Side Snowflake Stickers for Glass Windows, Large Christmas Decorations Decals with Santa Claus Reindeer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-7t9nmcDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WINTER CHRISTMAS DECORATIONS] You will get 9 sheets Halloween window clings, total 241Pcs, each sheet is 20cm x 30cm/7.8” x 11.8”. Various Christmas window jelly clings, such as snowflake, Santa Claus, Santa tree, reindeer sled, etc., which can be used to decorate glass windows and doors. [DOUBLE-SIDE PRINTED] Christmas snowflake window cling decals are made of PVC material with double-side printed. When you paste it on the window, the color effect displayed inside and outside of the window is the same bright and prefect. It is the wonderful Christmas decorations. [REMOVABLE & REUSABLE] Adopting the principle of electrostatic adsorption, no glue is needed during use, and no traces are left after removal. You can move multiple times to change the position of the window decals, so as achieving the best effect. The window sticker will not fade, you can save it and use it again next year. [EASY TO USE] NO NEED GLUE. Before you stick the window clings on the window, you need to wipe clean the windows that need to be pasted, spray a little water, and paste the window stickers on. (TIPS: Please use it in a flat and smooth place, such as: doors, windows, mirrors, refrigerator doors, microwave ovens.) [MERRY CHRISTMAS] We are a professional sticker manufacturer, providing you with the best quality products and services. If you have any questions, please contact us in time. Our friendly customer service always stands behind our product and reply all email within 24 hours. Wish you have a happy and warm Xmas~","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-7t9nmcDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YiFeng","source_asin":"B09KTWHJMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032903","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KTWHJMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KTWHJMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1032904,"name":"True 8-inch Loft Cotton/Foam Futon Mattress, Full-size, Twill Black Mattress Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hmft1DNTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The True 8-inch Loft mattress is ideal for individuals who prefer medium to firm sitting and sleeping. Because of the six inches of high-resilient long-lasting Fiber-Foam core (over twice the longevity of urethane foam), the True 8-inch Loft will provide the sit and sleep experience you want at a price that won't keep you up at night. Available in an array of kid-proof pet-proof fabric textures and colors to meet all decorating needs. Mattress features 11 Inch of materials compressed to eight inches providing the necessary inside out pressure for long-term durability, resilience and comfort. Zipper closed outer covering (rather than bulky machine stitched tape) making it more attractive and comfortable. Heaviest, most durable 100% polyester outer shell (seven ounces or better per square yard); seams will not split nor will tufting holes grow. Full border box construction provides excellent tailoring. 23 nylon precision tufted cords to ensure all fill materials stay in place to avoid material shifting and lumping. Mattress comes rolled and vacuum packed; please allow several days for all fill material to return to full length, width and thickness. Mattress outer covering is not removable. Sleeping area dimensions: full-size 54\" by 75\", queen-size 60\" by 80\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hmft1DNTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epic Furnishings","source_asin":"B01MYMSXEZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1032904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYMSXEZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYMSXEZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
